# RECORDED BASELINE for `make validate`. Generated by
# scripts/validate-timed.sh; promote a fresh one with 'make validate-baseline'.
# Checked by scripts/check-validate-baseline.sh, which runs inside validate.
#
# DO NOT HAND-EDIT, and do not treat these numbers as a budget. Nothing
# asserts a duration: this host runs several agents at once, and duration is
# bimodal by construction, so a threshold here would be a flake generator.
# What IS asserted is that the step set below still equals VALIDATE_STEPS,
# that the measurement is dated and in-window, and that no checkout path
# leaked into this public repo. See QUM-1286.
#
# go_cache=cold is REQUIRED, not incidental: a warm run serves ~43 of 44
# packages from the package cache and can report a duration for one of them,
# so a warm per-package baseline is a table of absences. lint_cache is
# reported rather than required — GOLANGCI_LINT_CACHE is per-worktree, so a
# fresh agent worktree pays cold and an established one does not.
#
# Fields: total_wall_s is measured end to end. driver_overhead_s is this
# script's own cost (probes and bookkeeping) and excludes the two structural
# costs of stepwise timing, which are one duplicate warm 'build' (validate
# runs it as a step and again as hooks-armed's prerequisite) and one make
# parse per step.
recorded=2026-08-22
cores=8
go=go1.26.6
os_arch=linux/arm64
go_cache=cold
lint_cache=warm
total_wall_s=284.53
driver_overhead_s=0.03
step	build	1.54
step	hooks-armed	1.53
step	proto-check	0.75
step	fmt-check	7.01
step	lint	1.59
step	test-lint-pin	12.76
step	test-race-gate	1.64
step	test-race	125.08
step	test-wirelog-helpers-unit	0.35
step	test-e2e-lockwait-unit	14.77
step	test-e2e-matrix-unit	97.46
step	test-always-loaded-budget-unit	14.28
step	always-loaded-budget	0.47
step	test-gitignore-classes	2.72
step	test-validate-timing-unit	1.38
step	check-validate-baseline	0.04
step	leak-scan	1.13
pkg	github.com/dmotles/sprawl/internal/supervisor	103.599
pkg	github.com/dmotles/sprawl/cmd	44.982
pkg	github.com/dmotles/sprawl/internal/hub	33.596
